<title>USA: Monsanto gets favorable IRS ruling.</title>
<headline>Monsanto gets favorable IRS ruling.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monsanto Co said it received a ruling from the U.S. Internal Revenue Service that the spinoff of the company's chemical business will be tax-free for federal income tax purposes.</p>
<p>Monsanto said a special meeting will be held August 18 in St. Louis where shareholders will vote on the spinoff and related matters.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
